Hi Bill,
can you please explain the folder structure in raw_images? It could be that you need to include one more folder in inDir.

So for example, instead of
raw_images <- "//internal/general/rmc/RMC_Images/NHM_Surveys/Stony Head MTA 02122020 to 05012021
you do:
raw_images <- "//internal/general/rmc/RMC_Images/NHM_Surveys/Stony Head MTA 02122020 to 05012021/Incidental photos"

The idea is that raw_images should contain Station directories.

I'm not sure that's the problem (can't see raw_images), but it might be. It would then also fix the wrongly assigned station / species columns.

Also, check if IDfrom = "directory" is intended. Since you have species tags (and from what I see no species directories) you may want to change that to "metadata".

Best,
Jürgen

